1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,307
In 2022, a glacial lake outburst in Hunza

2
00:00:03,347 --> 00:00:06,370
destroyed a Karakoram Highway bridge.

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:08,482
Northern Pakistan has more than

4
00:00:08,522 --> 00:00:10,290
three thousand glacial lakes.

5
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:13,370
Cloud often hides them from optical satellites.

6
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:17,690
NASA and ISRO's NISAR radar sees through cloud.

7
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:22,390
We're SARcastic Scientists from Islamabad. We built SARtale,

8
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:26,200
an interactive app that estimates lake water area

9
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:29,390
from NISAR passes and tracks changes over time.

10
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:33,690
Lake Watch brings the lakes together. Open Passu,

11
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:36,218
and see its radar image,

12
00:00:36,258 --> 00:00:38,580
its water in blue, and its history.

13
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:43,708
Passu's flag appeared with a processing update.

14
00:00:43,748 --> 00:00:47,350
It needs verification before we call it lake change.

15
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:50,350
Anyone can add a lake to follow.

16
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:54,280
When clouds close in, the lakes stay in view.
